  "description": "The Teammachine R 01 One exists for one reason: pure speed. The fastest road bike to come out of BMC to date, refined through an obsessive development process with Red Bull Advanced Technologies. The result is a carbon race bike that performs everywhere: from Grand Tours to Classics or crits, giving you the same aerodynamic advantage our pros rely on – every time you race.\nOur 01 Premium Carbon layup keeps things exceptionally light with stiffness exactly where a racer needs it. The SRAM Red AXS groupset with power meter reacts the moment you do, while DT Swiss ARC 1100 DICUT 65 mm wheels and the low-stack ICS Aero Gen 2 cockpit form a system that’s optimized to hold speed deep into the red.\nAnd then there’s the front end. The wide-stance fork isn’t just fast – it’s unmistakable. By calming turbulence and stabilizing airflow around the wheel, it gives the Teammachine R 01 ONE an aerodynamic advantage visible from a distance and undeniable on the road.\nWe engineered the platform; the speed you make with it is entirely yours.",
